[2026-01-30T00:15:08.082Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_017eAziR15fyL6owZVaDM5pV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've completed the Feature Scout idea generation for the Report Tabs context.\n\n**Summary: Feature Scout Ideas for Report Tabs Context**\n\nCreated 5 feature ideas for the Report Tabs context (ctx_1769727792597_5tyykyx):\n\n1. **Drag-to-Reorder Tab Sections** - Like Trello/Notion, add drag-and-drop to reorder findings and sources by importance. Use react-dnd or dnd-kit with persistent custom order.\n\n2. **Inline Expand/Collapse for Dense Content** - Like GitHub/Notion toggles, show first sentence with 'Show more'. Extend FindingCard's existing expandable pattern across all tabs.\n\n3. **Quick Filter Chips for Common Queries** - Like Gmail/Linear, add clickable chips for common filters ('High Confidence', 'News', 'People'). Chips toggle and combine.\n\n4. **Bulk Selection with Multi-Action Bar** - Like Gmail/Notion, add checkboxes for bulk selection with action bar ('Export Selected', 'Copy', 'Add to Collection'). Shift-click for range.\n\n5. **Copy-Rich Content to Clipboard** - Like Notion/documentation sites, add copy buttons that generate formatted content (title, confidence, sources) in plain text and rich HTML.\n\n**Observations about the Report Tabs codebase (from earlier reading):**\n- Well-organized 6 tab components (Overview, Findings, Sources, Entities, Analysis, Perspectives)\n- FindingsTab already has expandable cards with `expanded` state - pattern ready for extension\n- SourcesTab has table view with credibility distribution bar\n- EntitiesTab groups by type (person, organization, location, event)\n- AnalysisTab shows contradictions, gaps, and causal chains\n- PerspectivesTab has comparison cards and detailed expansion\n- Filtering logic exists (filterType, filterConfidence) - ready for chip enhancement\n- Good use of shared components (Section, TypeBadge, ConfidenceBadge, ProgressBar)"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3745,"cache_read_input_tokens":147548,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3745},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"5748c3b1-f00b-46fa-b9c3-b0b261137443"}
